This console never came out.

2
00:00:03,472 --> 00:00:06,849
In 2020, it sold for $360,000.

3
00:00:07,009 --> 00:00:10,418
It's a Nintendo PlayStation: a Sony CD drive for

4
00:00:10,428 --> 00:00:11,767
the Super Nintendo.

5
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,473
It was shown in 1991.

6
00:00:13,483 --> 00:00:17,303
Then Nintendo announced a deal with Philips instead.

7
00:00:17,463 --> 00:00:19,233
So Sony built its own console.

8
00:00:19,393 --> 00:00:22,188
The PlayStation sold more than 100 million.

9
00:00:22,348 --> 00:00:25,332
Nintendo walked away from Sony, and Sony built one

10
00:00:25,342 --> 00:00:27,361
of the best-selling consoles ever.
